  intro F E _ _ _ _ _ σ B hB nS nT JS JT hS hT ξ₀ hξ₀ hσ χS hχS rχS JB ξ hξ κ _ co hco ωd hωd omp htr
  intro l hl hinv p t hpt φ hφ
